### FilmFuse core-api - post-watch rating prompts. Token: see me.http.
# Movies your sessions picked in the last 14 days that you haven't rated (any route) or dismissed;
# newest first, at most 10. Rating with PUT /ratings/{movieId} (source POST_WATCH) removes one.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = paste-access-token-here
@movieId = 603

### Pending prompts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/pending-ratings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Rate it from the prompt (removes it)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ratings/{{movieId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"score": 8, "body": "Great with the group", "visibility": "FRIENDS", "source": "POST_WATCH"}

### Dismiss: never prompted again for this movie (204, idempotent; 404 unknown movie)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/pending-ratings/{{movieId}}/dismiss
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
